{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Girl In White&quot; is an emotive story focusing on youthful, high-school love and those wistful, almost fantastical feelings that everyone has experienced at least once.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/4957e5f8b8554b156856fe790a7d1b56.avif?t=1774353364\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, a high school senior, accidentally discovers the existence of the <strong>Dream Corridor</strong>\u2014a realm that bridges the living and the dead. Within it lies an endless hallway lined with doors, each one connecting distant corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is why, in dreams, we find ourselves transported across vast distances in the blink of an eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the discovery comes with an unintended side effect: Long gains the ability to see wandering spirits. What seems like a miracle at first quickly reveals itself to be more of a nightmare, as he realizes that restless <strong>Ghosts</strong> have always <strong>Surrounded Us</strong>\u2014unseen, until now...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/0d187cc77091cee6be571c939f5b93b7.avif?t=1774353364\" width=251 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just your typical story-driven game,</strong> this is where action meets introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond battling wandering spirits in the mortal realm, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that reveal hidden sides of your personality\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school turn-based dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre personality quizzes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot shiny stuff, equip questionable gear</strong>, and go toe-to-toe with a terrifying cast of shadowy spirit-things</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A fever dream moment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/3350418ad26be68d15040366daf82b67c729613f.jpg"},{"name":"Trang, my middle school friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/7fc98e0b0c9ce6074ade7504b06cfa4e8c8f2d4f.jpg"},{"name":"There you are. My quintessential dream girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/1764f02f84ac8920ce55eba9c565d03b09328f93.jpg"},{"name":"My Walk Home After School","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/7732a8827a76cbde4cbb8b65ba1602e35fcf9d0f.jpg"},{"name":"Forever a Flutter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/31eb1aca42360ea6292b28d4dde12e9da5c81f89.jpg"},{"name":"A Dream's Kiss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/0dad7debfb00e176d7753feef14d139419bd1733.jpg"},{"name":"The Paths Ahead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/aa704a6f67416a5cb7af57107ce37ac36df0742a.jpg"},{"name":"Afterstory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4108010/3c82b44b58aad5f341c4b549c270ec6d04661bdb.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108010?t=1774353364","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/852fb0316622ab306d8f66cca660773346ab91ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774353364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/a0b31